{
  "info": {
    "name": "SafeRx Drug Safety API v1.2.0",
    "description": "Comprehensive drug safety screening for 33,000 Egyptian pharma + semi-pharma products.\n\nAPI Version: 1.2.0 — Full bilingual (English + Arabic) support.\n\n## Getting Started\n\n1. **Get a free API key:** Run \"Register Free API Key\" to get a key\n2. **Set the key:** The key is automatically saved to the `api_key` environment variable\n3. Run any safety check request\n\n## Authentication\n\nThe Drug Safety API uses API keys (not session tokens).\n- Free tier: 5 requests/minute, 100/day\n- Header: `X-SafeRx-API-Key: sfx_free_xxxxx`\n\n## Bilingual Support\n\nAll text fields include both English and Arabic variants:\n- Drug names: `brand_name` + `brand_name_ar`\n- PLLR rationale: `pregnancy_rationale` + `pregnancy_rationale_ar`\n- DDI: `description` + `description_ar`, `recommendation` + `recommendation_ar`\n- Food: `brief_en` + `brief_ar`\n- Alerts: `message` + `message_ar`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "saferx"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "X-SafeRx-API-Key",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "value",
        "value": "{{api_key}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "in",
        "value": "header",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "description": "Get a free API key to start making requests. Session tokens are for the website — the Drug Safety API uses API keys.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register Free API Key",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.api_key) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('api_key', jsonData.api_key);",
                  "    console.log('API key saved: ' + jsonData.api_key);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "User-Agent",
                "value": "SafeRx-Postman/1.0"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"developer@example.com\",\n  \"name\": \"Test Developer\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/developers/keys/free",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "developers", "keys", "free"]
            },
            "description": "Register for a free API key. The key is automatically saved to the `api_key` environment variable.\n\n**Free tier limits:** 5 requests/minute, 100 requests/day."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Session Token (website only)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (jsonData.token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('token', jsonData.token);",
                  "    console.log('Token saved (valid 5 min)');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "User-Agent",
                "value": "SafeRx-Postman/1.0"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/security/token",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "security", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Session tokens are for the website frontend, NOT the Drug Safety API.\n\nThe Drug Safety endpoints require `X-SafeRx-API-Key` (from \"Register Free API Key\").\n\nSession tokens expire in 5 minutes."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Drug Safety",
      "description": "Screen drugs across 6 safety domains: adverse effects (ae), drug interactions (ddi), pregnancy & lactation (pllr), food interactions (food), clinical considerations (clinical), and dosing (dose).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Full Safety Check (2 drugs, all domains)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "User-Agent",
                "value": "SafeRx-Postman/1.0"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"drugs\": [\"Augmentin 1g\", \"Marivan\"]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/drug_safety/check",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "drug_safety", "check"]
            },
            "description": "Screen 2 drugs across ALL 6 safety domains. Augmentin + Marivan has a known major DDI.\n\nResponse includes bilingual drug identity (brand_name + brand_name_ar), all safety data, and Arabic alert messages."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Check with Patient Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "User-Agent",
                "value": "SafeRx-Postman/1.0"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"drugs\": [\"Augmentin 1g\", \"Glucophage 500mg\", \"Marivan\"],\n  \"patient_profile\": {\n    \"populations\": [\"geriatric\", \"renal\"],\n    \"conditions\": [\"diabetes\", \"hypertension\"]\n  }\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/drug_safety/check",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "drug_safety", "check"]
            },
            "description": "Screen drugs with patient context for personalized clinical alerts.\n\n**Populations:** pediatric, geriatric, cardiac, hepatic, renal\n**Conditions:** arrhythmia, asthma, bph, coronary, depression, diabetes, epilepsy, gi_bleeding, glaucoma, heart_failure, hypertension, hyperthyroidism, hypothyroidism, parkinsons"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "DDI Only (selective domains)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "User-Agent",
                "value": "SafeRx-Postman/1.0"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"drugs\": [\"Augmentin 1g\", \"Marivan\"],\n  \"include\": [\"ddi\"]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/drug_safety/check",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "drug_safety", "check"]
            },
            "description": "Check drug interactions only (smallest, fastest response).\n\nUse `include` to request specific domains: ae, ddi, pllr, food, clinical, dose."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Pregnancy + Food Safety",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "User-Agent",
                "value": "SafeRx-Postman/1.0"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"drugs\": [\"Marivan\"],\n  \"include\": [\"pllr\", \"food\"]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/drug_safety/check",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "drug_safety", "check"]
            },
            "description": "Check pregnancy/lactation safety and food interactions for Warfarin.\n\nPLLR response includes bilingual rationale (pregnancy_rationale + pregnancy_rationale_ar), trimester-specific risks, BBW with text_en/text_ar, and LactMed pharmacokinetics."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Single Drug (AE + Dose)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "User-Agent",
                "value": "SafeRx-Postman/1.0"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"drugs\": [\"Aspirin\"],\n  \"include\": [\"ae\", \"dose\"]\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/drug_safety/check",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "drug_safety", "check"]
            },
            "description": "Check adverse effects (including Black Box Warnings) and maximum daily dose for a single drug."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Metadata",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "User-Agent",
                "value": "SafeRx-Postman/1.0"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/drug_safety/metadata",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "drug_safety", "metadata"]
            },
            "description": "Get available populations, conditions, database versions, risk scales, and tier limits.\n\nNo authentication required."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
